URqsBvdKUrhCi3H9joQDZbvclydr174MTz5Ww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDSL2XEFCsQcb35ZNGKnvbgigntGGvf6Ps2o_uUVJip5g&oe=6A661301"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "795253620229683", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619159_795253626896349_2733651366559496392_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eVIiJA15wfcQ7kNvwH5hI-q&_nc_oc=Adrj9Yt6AhYZxNWTRpomxK3At0KmxtFBs4ahCaT_9AZq_Np_4dYTr-T7MHurySxrecQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBeQaDqv65oPXXPNicGUHZVJVAvx2eXvgv35iJpGLdI_A&oe=6A66040F"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "841669665498746", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618093_841669668832079_9141116026824121782_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DSpxL8MrLpcQ7kNvwF05orD&_nc_oc=Adrs4hXJFwWnVqqNmZGVpHNEYsggUeHLdxgaVZ49OI1C52uXbvUxOLvwic5z5pXy_0c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDyAu0LcsP4cm_A09DPMwJQAsQDIZw-AvS76Sm-vzuQnQ&oe=6A66183C"}, {"file_name": "13 (1).png", "id": "1636087437761320", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619450_1636087444427986_186497130864574751_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4Ld6uvgvb5QQ7kNvwGeiElh&_nc_oc=Adob7xbreYOLPyZanLPuLIBXT44UGXRQAx9Xl7xZaar2nPbcKGb4PKWZg_jZ1Xz6OPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAQNOsLhyh7SNyJcXVGt5bbjCzWjuSnb7tfD5iaXBsIfg&oe=6A65F561"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560X1440_CoverLandscape (3).png", "id": "880993064391941", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618288_880993067725274_615007872304633567_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=refCozwjC-kQ7kNvwECr2k4&_nc_oc=AdpQpXydzY1SNauhGh7HHkPUD-Byck12VmpmMjYcha-4WkHJQ-8ar3Tw2tj6pmsweJc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCHlu_SfNyhnQl5uM2Y4yW7m_uwJpQTuUO67goEAvuKxg&oe=6A6606AD"}, "display_name": "Rhythm FAME : Influencer Edition", "keywords": ["Immersive", "Responsive", "Challenging", "Flow", "song"], "long_description": "Rhythm Fame is an **immersive**, **fun**, **engaging**, and **challenging** VR rhythm journey where you become an influencer\u2014your Creator Profile grows as you perform, compete, and chase the spotlight.\n\n* **Influencer progression:** earn **Fame Points**, **level up your Creator Profile**, and watch your status climb after every run.\n{1852707778693177}\n* **Live score competition:** there\u2019s **no static win bar**\u2014you advance by **beating other creators\u2019 scores** while their **progress bars rise in real time**. Track **leaderboard-style** benchmarks like the **Average** and the **World Record**.\n{1508763650421247}\n* **Easy to learn, hard to master:** controls are simple\u2014**LRUD arrows (Left/Right/Up/Down)**\u2014but mastering timing, streaks, and faster patterns takes skill.\n* **VR rhythm gameplay (clear + responsive):** play on **3\u20134 neon lanes** with a central **hit zone**, using your **glowing wand controllers** for tight, **satisfying**, responsive timing.\n{1404922804549817}\n\n* **Flow-state pacing + story replay:** intensity follows the music to keep you \u201cin the zone,\u201d through a connected song story from **college dorm music group** to **world-tour selection**\u2014built for quick sessions, repeat runs, and constant improvement.\n{1218134910275215}", "short_description": "Rhythm Fame is a fun, engaging, challenging and responsive VR rhythm climb where you become an influencer. Hit LRUD (Left/Right/Up/Down) beats on 3\u20134 neon lanes with glowing wand controllers, timing hits in the central zone for Like-bursts. Songs are linked as one story\u2014from dorm band to world-tour tryouts\u2014with flow-state pacing that adapts to track intensity. Earn Fame Points, level up your Creator Profile, and chase Average vs World Record\u2014no static win bar."}]}, "developer_name": "Biswa Games", "developer_privacy_policy_